<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strew</i> or <i>deck with flowers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				890
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλὴν ῥόδοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευὴ ἠνθισμένη</span>
			<i>adorned, embroidered with flowers,</i> ibid.): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν λέξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Isoc.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>gather, cull flowers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>colour, dye, stain,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρα] ἀ. τὴν χεῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					547a18
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνθισμένοι φαρμάκοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.98
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γάρ σε μὴ . . γνῶσ᾽ . . ὧδ᾽
				ἠνθισμένον</span> thus <i>disguised</i> or with
				<i>silvered</i> hair, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα πυρὸς ἀκμαῖς
			ἠνθισμένα</span> meat <i>browned</i> at the fire, <i><span class="en">
				Epicr.
				6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος ἠνθισμένος</span> wine
				<i>flavoured with flowers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.81
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθίζουσα, ἡ,</span> a <i>plaster,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				13.856
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
